/*
 * User device-tree overlay — intentionally empty. Avoids the
 * /include/ "system-conf.dtsi" reference because PetaLinux 2022.2 +
 * Avnet u96v2 BSP does not auto-generate system-conf.dtsi via dtgen
 * for the bare petalinux-config --get-hw-description path. The BSP DT
 * already covers PSU/DDR/peripherals; we add nothing custom here.
 */
